======= dp notes =======

• Those who cannot repeat the past are condemned to repeat it

• Approaches
    Memoization -> Top-Down
    Tabulation -> Bottom-up
    Space Optimizastion

• Recursion -> Memoization -> Tabulation -> Space Optimizastion

• Recursion
    - whenever try all possible ways or count or best way problems
    - (Shortcut)
        1 try to represent problem in terms of indexs and write base case
        2 do all possible stuff on that indexs
        3 sum of all stuffs -> count all ways
          min(of all stuff) -> find min

• Memoization
    - tend to store the value of sub problems in some map or table or array.
    - 1 declare dp array and pass as parameters
      2 update dp array with computed value at last
      3 check for dp array for pre existing values
    - TC -> O(n)
    - SC -> O(n) + O(n) (Dp array + Recursion stack space)

• Tabulation
    - 1 declare dp array
      2 start from base case as initialisation 
      3 loop and update dp           
    - TC -> O(n)
    - SC -> O(n) (Dp array only)

• Space Optimizastion
    - remove dp array by using variables only
    - whenever we have something like [index-1] or [index-2] we can always do Space Optimizastion

